  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ burhbota ⁊ brycgbota ⁊ scipforðunga aginne man georne ⁊ fyrdunga eac swá, á ðonne ðearf sy for mænelicre neode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And henceforth the repair of fortificatons and bridges, and the preparation of ships and the equipment of military forces likewise shall be diligently undertaken for the common need, whenever the occasion arises.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ burhbota ⁊ bricbota ⁊ scipforðunga aginne man georne, ⁊ fyrdunga eac swa, á þænne þearf si for gemænelicre neode.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
